{"3430280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seaward", "steam_appid": 3430280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our community!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/f1fb4ef4b2cbabfebf63fc91e2ec0be0.avif?t=1785150950\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/a18adc21b3e0b45846d386a704d7f998.avif?t=1785150950\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Quick Feature Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ Exploration<br>🛥️ Ship Customization<br>🖼️ Decorating<br>📸 Taking Photos<br>🌱 Gardening<br>🎣 Fishing<br>💬 Dialogues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/2c129fb27d76f980165aa1a9cb46dde8.avif?t=1785150950\" width=780 height=94 /></span>In this flooded world you <strong>become a courier</strong>, connecting people with your ship. Scattered across islands you'll find resources to <strong>improve your ship</strong> and <strong>make it your home</strong>. Help out cute characters and build a community. And don't forget to take photos along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/77795b0f428e5e69a460509b551f5787.poster.avif?t=1785150950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/77795b0f428e5e69a460509b551f5787.webm?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/77795b0f428e5e69a460509b551f5787.mp4?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3cc8fefd3af48cd25a8abc40df23aac5.avif?t=1785150950\" width=780 height=94 /></span>In a grid-like view, you can build new things onto your ship. Or change the ship's hull entirely, which will determine the shape and size of the building space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/48b44bb5680758771309f9c5098c368a.poster.avif?t=1785150950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/48b44bb5680758771309f9c5098c368a.webm?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/48b44bb5680758771309f9c5098c368a.mp4?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/6478d0f0514dcc8048dfaa8945affb39.avif?t=1785150950\" width=780 height=94 /></span>This world inhibits several unique characters. Get to know them and help each other out! Share your skills and you might get something in return. Together you can build a wholesome community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8f9df8091210b22e6bd0cb21b7d4df68.poster.avif?t=1785150950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8f9df8091210b22e6bd0cb21b7d4df68.webm?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/8f9df8091210b22e6bd0cb21b7d4df68.mp4?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/6fecc0caf591a7f1e74ac23f6af020af.avif?t=1785150950\" width=780 height=94 /></span>Equipped with a photo camera, you can make travel memories. Catalogue birds, plants, characters or just take some snapshots of pretty vistas. They all get saved into your personal journal. In the end, it’s your very own journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3bcf2536b6d6d8a2414bfacfbc626c31.poster.avif?t=1785150950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3bcf2536b6d6d8a2414bfacfbc626c31.webm?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3bcf2536b6d6d8a2414bfacfbc626c31.mp4?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Quick Feature Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ Exploration<br>🛥️ Ship Customization<br>🖼️ Decorating<br>📸 Taking Photos<br>🌱 Gardening<br>🎣 Fishing<br>💬 Dialogues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_par