journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3bcf2536b6d6d8a2414bfacfbc626c31.poster.avif?t=1785150950\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3bcf2536b6d6d8a2414bfacfbc626c31.webm?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/3bcf2536b6d6d8a2414bfacfbc626c31.mp4?t=1785150950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Seaward is a cozy exploration game where you build a ship to discover a flooded world. Find resources and power your ship with renewable energies. Meet unique characters and help them out to build a wholesome community. Make the journey your own by taking photos and filling up your journal.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Ukrainian, French, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/d3a79102f7cc657fd5154c8e495fa18a0f5a7fe5/header.jpg?t=1785150950", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/e62e5e14008aa25e239bf9a714192f5f63b8d0a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785150950", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/e62e5e14008aa25e239bf9a714192f5f63b8d0a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785150950", "website": "https://theroofinteractive.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or comparable<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960 or 